    "body": "## SubtideX v1.5.0\n\nFirst production-ready release with the Tidal redesign and reliable caption extraction.\n\n### Highlights\n- **Transcript-panel extraction** — opens YouTube’s transcript panel and scrapes captions from the page (works when API URLs are token-gated)\n- **Tidal UI** — calm popup with video preview card, dark mode, and live 3-step progress panel\n- **Success toasts** — caption count, filename, and “Download again”\n- **Reliable connection** — auto re-injects content script after extension reloads\n- **Updated README** — install, usage, troubleshooting, and dev docs\n\n### Install\n1. Download **subtidex.zip** below\n2. Unzip and load the folder via **Load unpacked** on `chrome://extensions/`\n   — or clone this repo and load the project folder directly\n\n### Requirements\n- Chrome or Chromium-based browser\n- YouTube video with captions / transcript available"
